## 6.3 Payroll API — API-021

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/payroll-runs` |
| Layanan | SVC-017 payroll-service |
| Tabel | `pay.payroll_run`, `pay.payroll_result`, `pay.statutory_contribution` |
| Referensi | 9.17, INT-003/007 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                                        | Deskripsi                                      | Catatan |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------- |
| `POST /v1/payroll-runs`                               | Buat periode penggajian.                       | 201     |
| `POST /v1/payroll-runs/{id}/calculate`               | Hitung payroll (proses asinkron).              | 202     |
| `GET /v1/payroll-runs/{id}`                          | Status & ringkasan run.                        |         |
| `POST /v1/payroll-runs/{id}/approve`                 | Setujui hasil perhitungan.                     |         |
| `POST /v1/payroll-runs/{id}/post`                    | Posting ke GL → `payroll.run.completed.v1`.    | **EOS** |
| `GET /v1/payroll-runs/{id}/results?employeeId=…`     | Rincian hasil per karyawan (PII sensitif).     |         |
| `GET /v1/payroll-runs/{id}/statutory-contributions` | Iuran BPJS untuk pelaporan (INT-007).          |         |

* `calculate` bersifat **asinkron** (`202 Accepted`) karena volume; status dipantau via `GET`.
* `post` menghasilkan *event* Exactly-Once → GL & Treasury (INT-003).

